  m_Name: StingerHeavyRobot
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Eldoria::Eldoria.Units.UnitTemplate
  displayName: Stinger Heavy Robot
  role: 2
  description: 'The Rask''s six-legged siege engine: a heavily armored war robot
    with 25 health and Armor Level 5, proof against almost everything but the heaviest
    guns. The Plasma Mortar on its back shells a spot up to 50 m away once a turn:
    everyone within 2.5 m takes 5 damage at penetration 3 (enough to hurt most armor),
    unless terrain shields them. Its Stabilizers let it fire even after moving. Mechanical:
    it strides 30 m but can''t sprint. Large: friendly Biological soldiers within
    5 m can shelter behind it (half-cover). Heavy Support, so you can field more
    than one.'
